<mxCell id="h82" value="Many readers together, a writer alone. The policy for new readers while a writer waits is the design choice" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="50" width="820" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
